   "kind": "heading",
   "text": "2.6. Joins Between Tables"
  },
  {
   "kind": "early",
   "text": "Thus far, our queries have only accessed one table at a time",
   "where": "p < div#TUTORIAL-JOIN.sect1 < div#docContent < div#pgContentWrap.col-11 < div.row"
  },
  {
   "kind": "mid",
   "text": "The tables are simply listed in the FROM clause, and the comparison",
   "where": "p < div#TUTORIAL-JOIN.sect1 < div#docContent < div#pgContentWrap.col-11 < div.row"
  },
  {
   "kind": "late",
   "text": "You will encounter this style of abbreviating quite frequently",
   "where": "p < div#TUTORIAL-JOIN.sect1 < div#docContent < div#pgContentWrap.col-11 < div.row"
  },
  {
   "kind": "code_line",
   "text": "FROM weather LEFT OUTER JOIN cities ON weather.city = cities.name;",
   "where": "pre.programlisting < div#TUTORIAL-JOIN.sect1 < div#docContent < div#pgContentWrap.col-11 < div.row"
  }
